# =========================================================================
#                      MARKIVO ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# =========================================================================
# Configuration lives next to each service — copy these to `.env` and fill in:
#
#   backend/.env.example   → backend/.env    (server, auth, AI, feature flags)
#   frontend/.env.example  → frontend/.env   (VITE_API_URL)
#
# Notes:
# - AI (Claude): set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in backend/.env to switch content,
#   slogans, and the Markiv agent from smart templates to live generation.
# - Telegram: fully built but POST-MVP — disabled by default behind
#   TELEGRAM_ENABLED in backend/.env. Bot tokens are entered per business
#   through the dashboard UI (encrypted at rest), NOT via env vars.
# - Google Places discovery: set GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY in backend/.env;
#   leave blank to run with deterministic mock discovery.
# =========================================================================
